    "고른 사진과 동영상이 원본 그대로, 찍은 시각 그대로 호스트의 사진 앱에 들어가요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The photos and videos you pick go into the host's Photos app as originals, at the time they were taken."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The photos and videos you choose go into the host's Photos app as originals, with their original time taken."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选的照片和视频会保持原画质和拍摄时间，存入接收方的“照片”App。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
